  "scenes": [],
  "scene": 0,
  "note": "6-operator FM voice. Technically it's phase modulation, same as in Yamaha DX7. ATNs are operator outputs. Their gains are modulation indexes. And SEQ's RATEs are Harmonicity Ratios. "
